    "body": "• Retention period for data (strict period must be set & included in the notice).\r\n• Privacy notice to include how to opt out of promotional.\r\n• Inform people what is being done with their data (through the privacy policy)\r\n• Children privacy in privacy notice\r\n• Message for current users not required, new users need to be informed about new marketing.\r\n• Minimum age to register without consent. The UK is 13 years old. (consider other countries)\r\n• Auditory trail with privacys vs consents.\r\n• Consider if school postcode is private information.\r\n• Right to be forgotten (a manual process documented). Other processes documented too. Store them centrally.\r\n• Finally, do some ICO website high level law reading. https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-pecr/electronic-and-telephone-marketing/electronic-mail-marketing/",
